; Staging, unstaging and discarding every selection of lines and hunks
; leaves exactly what a line model of the selection gives, at a missing
; final newline, in CRLF files and among blank lines, with a user's
; diff.suppressBlankEmpty set.
> (run-edges! '(no-newline-append no-newline-change-last no-newline-added no-newline-removed no-newline-staged))
(trials 96 failures ())
> (run-edges! '(crlf crlf-staged blank-lines))
(trials 52 failures ())
